### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Library REST API — Generated
###
###  Start the server:
###    dotnet run --project path/to/project --urls "http://localhost:5201"
###
###  The database starts empty. Add "--SeedDemoData true" to insert one
###  sample row per entity.
###
###  Then click "Send Request" above any request below.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ──────────── Books ────────────

### List all books
GET http://localhost:5201/api/books

### Get book by ISBN
GET http://localhost:5201/api/books/example-isbn

### Create a new book
POST http://localhost:5201/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "sample",
    "Author": "sample",
    "ISBN": "example-isbn",
    "Pages": 1,
    "Genre": "Fiction"
}

### ──────────── Patrons ────────────

### List all patrons
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons

### Get patron by Email
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com

### Create a new patron
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "sample",
    "Email": "user@test.com",
    "MemberSince": "2026-07-20",
    "Status": "Active",
    "MaxItems": 0,
    "CurrentBorrowCount": 0,
    "OutstandingFines": 0
}

### Action: CheckOut
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/checkOut
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "BookId": "example-isbn"
}

### Action: Suspend
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/suspend

### Action: CloseAccount
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/closeAccount

### Action: Reinstate
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/reinstate

### ──────────── Loans ────────────

### List loans for patron
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/loans

### Get loan by id for patron
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/loans/1

### Action: Renew
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/loans/1/renew

### Action: Return
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/loans/1/return

### ──────────── Fines ────────────

### List fines for patron
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/fines

### Get fine by id for patron
GET http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/fines/1

### Action: Pay
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/fines/1/pay

### Action: Waive
POST http://localhost:5201/api/patrons/user@test.com/fines/1/waive

### ──────────── PremiumPatrons ────────────

### List all premiumPatrons
GET http://localhost:5201/api/premiumPatrons

### Get premiumPatron by Email
GET http://localhost:5201/api/premiumPatrons/user@test.com

### Create a new premiumPatron
POST http://localhost:5201/api/premiumPatrons
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "sample",
    "Email": "user@test.com",
    "RewardPoints": 0,
    "Tier": "Silver",
    "PriorityAccess": false
}

